  "text": "G\n·\nGenesys AQM\nQUALITY INTELLIGENCE\nMONITOR\n◌\nOverview\nQUALITY\n◷\nEvaluations\n▥\nAnalytics\n◎\nCalibration\nCONFIGURATION\n◇\nPolicies\n▤\nEvaluation Forms\n▦\nQuestion Groups\n⚙\nSettings\nINTERACTIONS\n☷\nConversations\n◈\nConversation review\n✦\nPowered by Jev\n\nTyped AI decisions, shaped into clear quality signals.\n\nV0.17 OPERATIONAL OVERVIEW • 2026\nWorkspace / Groups\nADMIN\nJev managed securely by automation service\nCONFIGURATION\nQuestion Groups\n\nVersioned reusable templates. Forms retain independent snapshots.\n\nImport reusable group\nNew group asset\nStatus\nAll statuses\nDraft\nPublished\nRetired\nVersion\nAll versions\nLatest version per family\nUsage\nAll usage\nUsed\nUnused\nSearch\n4 results\nName ↓\n\t\nStatus\n\t\nVersion\n\t\nQuestions\n\t\nUsed by forms\n\t\nLast modified\n\nResolution & Next Steps\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t3\t0\t10/1/2026\nIdentity & Security Verification\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t3\t0\t10/1/2026\nCustomer Experience / Empathy\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t3\t0\t10/1/2026\nCall Closing\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t2\t0\t10/1/2026\nSave starter library to server\nResolution & Next Steps · v1 · PUBLISHED\nExport JSON\nEdit as new version\nRetire group asset\nAsset name\nAsset description\nView history\nReusable questions\n\nQuestion weights determine the overall score. Read-only published definition.\n\nYes threshold65%\nResolution & Next Steps\nGroup name\nGroup description\nGroup scoring\nUse group scoring settings\n01\nOwnership\nYes / No\n\nDid the agent take responsibility for progressing the customer’s issue rather than simply deflecting it?\n\nWeight 1 · Enabled · ID ownership\n\n↑\n↓\nRead only\n02\nResolution\nMultiple choice\n\nWhat is the best description of the issue outcome by the end of the conversation?\n\nWeight 1.5 · Enabled · ID resolution\n\nFully resolved (fully_resolved · credit 1)\nThe customer’s issue was resolved in the conversation.\nPartially resolved (partially_resolved · credit 0.5)\nMeaningful progress, but further action remains.\nUnresolved (unresolved · credit 0)\nThe issue remained unresolved with no meaningful progress.\nNot applicable (not_applicable · credit unscored)\nThe conversation does not present a resolvable issue.\n↑\n↓\nRead only\n03\nClear next steps\nYes / No\n\nWhere further action was needed, did the agent state clear next steps? If no further action was needed, answer yes.\n\nWeight 1 · Enabled · ID next_steps\n\n↑\n↓\nRead only\nAdd question",
